<title>USA: Lowe's Q3 net income up.</title>
<headline>Lowe's Q3 net income up.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollars in Thousands, Except Per Share Data</p>
<p>					     Third Quarter</p>
<p> Total Dollars: Pct. Change   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales		    24     $2,193,239   $1,765,992</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	  22	1,627,073    1,337,049</p>
<p> Gross Margin	   32	  566,166	428,943</p>
<p> Total Expenses	 25	  449,607	360,736</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Earnings     71	  116,559	 68,207</p>
<p> Income Taxes	   70	   41,376	 24,288</p>
<p> Net Earnings	   71	   75,183	 43,919</p>
<p> Dividends		 8	    8,636	  8,031</p>
<p>Per Share:</p>
<p>Earnings</p>
<p>  Primary		 59		.43	    .27</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted	 59		.43	    .27</p>
<p> Dividends				 .050	   .050</p>
<p>Shares Outstanding*</p>
<p>   Primary		 8	  172,954	160,766</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	 1	  172,973	171,663</p>
<p>* (Weighted Average in Thousands)</p>
<p>				  Nine Months Year to Date</p>
<p> Total Dollars: Pct. Change   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales		   22     $6,558,745   $5,378,740</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	 21	4,887,287    4,034,115</p>
<p> Gross Margin	  24	1,671,458    1,344,625</p>
<p> Total Expenses	24	1,303,981    1,050,673</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Earnings    25	  367,477	293,952</p>
<p> Income Taxes	  23	  130,953	106,100</p>
<p> Net Earnings	  26	  236,524	187,852</p>
<p> Dividends	     12	   25,208	 22,439</p>
<p>Per Share:</p>
<p>Earnings</p>
<p> Primary		 22	     1.43	   1.17</p>
<p> Fully Diluted	 23	     1.39	   1.13</p>
<p> Dividends		7	     .150	   .140</p>
<p>Shares Outstanding**</p>
<p>  Primary		 3	  165,853	160,308</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted	 1	  172,562	171,206</p>
<p>NOTE: There was a negative 19 basis point impact ($4.05 million) related to the company's ongoing store relocation program and the closing of underperforming stores.  In third quarter 1995 these costs ($3.5 million) were charged against the restructuring reserve.</p>
<p>A LIFO charge of $500,000 had a positive 18 basis point impact when compared to the $3.5 million charge in last year's third quarter.</p>
<p>Charges in the third quarter of 1996 for future openings were $2.3 million compared to $2.8 million in last year's third quarter. Also, charges for prior openings were $831,000 compared to $1.6 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Lowe's Cos Inc.</p>
